### Health Check Standards

- **Health Check Endpoints**: Use **@nestjs/terminus** package to implement health check endpoints.
  - Expose health check endpoints (e.g., `/health`, `/health/liveness`, `/health/readiness`) following Kubernetes health check conventions.
  - Include checks for critical dependencies:
    - Database connectivity
    - Cache/Redis availability (if applicable)
    - External service dependencies
    - Disk space and memory (if applicable)
  - Configure appropriate timeouts for health checks to prevent cascading failures.
  - Return standardized responses with overall status and individual component statuses.
  - Document health check endpoints in OpenAPI/Swagger documentation.
